	(descr "Socket for Espressif ESP32-DevKitC V4 (38 pin): 2x 1x19 female headers 25.40 mm apart, plus an unpopulated third 1x19 row 22.86 mm from row 1 for narrow clones (same pad numbers/nets). Pin 1 = 3V3 (antenna end). USB edge faces +X. Silk: DevKit outline, antenna overhang, USB arrow.")
